            {
              "id": "neetprep_physics_q450811",
              "type": "mcq",
              "originalOrder": 9,
              "topic": "Instantaneous Speed & Instantaneous Velocity",
              "subtopic": "Instantaneous Speed & Instantaneous Velocity",
              "sub_category": "Instantaneous Speed & Instantaneous Velocity",
              "chapter": "Motion in a Straight Line",
              "exam_name": "NCERT Based",
              "question": "For the one-dimensional motion, described by <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(x=t-\\sin t\\)</span>\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td>(a)</td><td><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(x(t)&gt;0\\)</span> for all <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(t&gt;0\\)</span></td></tr><tr><td>(b)</td><td><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(v(t)&gt;0\\)</span>&nbsp;for all <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(t&gt;0\\)</span>.</td></tr><tr><td>(c)</td><td><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(a(t)&gt;0\\)</span>&nbsp;for all <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(t&gt;0\\)</span>.</td></tr><tr><td>(d)</td><td><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(v(t)&gt;0\\)</span>&nbsp;lies between <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(0\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-tex\">\\(2\\)</span>.</td></tr></tbody></table>Choose the correct option:\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td>1.</td><td>(b), (c)</td></tr><tr><td>2.</td><td>(a), (b), (d)</td></tr><tr><td>3.</td><td>(a), (d)</td></tr><tr><td>4.</td><td>(b), (d)&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table>",
              "options": [
                "(1)",
                "(2)",
                "(3)",
                "(4)"
              ],
              "correct": 2,
              "explanation": "Hint:The motion is described by the equation \\(x(t)=t−\\sin⁡(t)\\).\n\nStep 1:Find the variation of position\\(x(t)\\).Given:\\(x(t)=t−\\sin⁡(t)\\)\nSince \\(\\sin⁡(t)\\) oscillates, it doesn't prevent \\(x(t) \\) from being positive\nfor all \\(t>0.\\)\nSpecifically:\\(x(t)≥t−1(\\text{because the maximum value of} \\sin(t)\n~\\text{is}~\\pm1) \\)\nFor \\(t>1, x(t)>0 \\). At \\(t=0, x(0)=0, \\)and for\\(0&lt;x&lt;1\\),\\(\\sin x &lt;x\\)\n\\(x(t)&gt;0 ~\\text{for all }~ t&gt;0~\\text{ is true.}\\)\n\nStep 2: Fine the variation of velocity\\(v(t)\\)\nThe velocity\\(v(t)\\) is given by the derivative of \\(x(t):\\)\n\\(v(t)=\\frac{dx}{dt}=1−\\cos⁡(t)\\)\n\\(\\text{At}~ t=0, v(0)=1−\\cos⁡(0)=1−1=0.\\)\n\\(\\text{At}~ t=360, v(0)=1−\\cos⁡(360)=1−1=0.\\)\nAs \\(t\\) increases, \\(v(t)\\) oscillates but never goes below \\(0.\\)\n\\(v(t)>0~\\text{ for all}~ t>0\\) is false since\\( v(360)=0.\\)\nThe correct variation of velocity is\n\\(v(t)>0\\)and it lies between \\(0\\)and \\(2\\). Therefore, statement \\(d\\) is\ncorrect.\n\nStep 3: Find the variation of acceleration\\(a(t)\\)\nThe acceleration \\(a(t)\\) is the derivative of \\(v(t):\\)\n\\(a(t)=\\frac{dv}{dt}​=\\sin(t)\\)\nThe function \\(\\sin(t)\\)oscillates between \\(-1\\) and \\(1.\\) Therefore:\n\\(a(t)>0~\\text{ for all } t>0\\)is false because \\(\\sin(t)\\)can be negative.\nThe only true statements are (a) and (d).\nHence, option (3) is the correct answer.<div style=\"margin-top:1.25rem; padding:0.85rem 1rem; background:var(--bg-secondary); border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:0.6rem; font-weight:600; font-size:0.88rem;\"><span>📊 Student Attempt Analytics</span><span style=\"padding:2px 8px; border-radius:12px; font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:700; background:rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15); color:#d97706;\">🟡 Medium · 43% Got This Correct</span></div><div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:0.5rem; text-align:center; font-size:0.82rem;\"><div style=\"padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-primary); border:1px solid var(--border);\"><div>(1)</div><div style=\"font-weight:700; margin-top:2px;\">17%</div></div><div style=\"padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-primary); border:1px solid var(--border);\"><div>(2)</div><div style=\"font-weight:700; margin-top:2px;\">32%</div></div><div style=\"padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:rgba(34,197,94,0.12); border:1.5px solid #22c55e;\"><div style=\"color:#16a34a; font-weight:700;\">(3) ✓</div><div style=\"font-weight:800; color:#16a34a; margin-top:2px;\">43%</div></div><div style=\"padding:0.4rem; border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-primary); border:1px solid var(--border);\"><div>(4)</div><div style=\"font-weight:700; margin-top:2px;\">10%</div></div></div></div>",
